abstract: "Standalone supporting artifacts for the manuscript From Conceptual Model to Runtime Governance: An Ontology-Driven Multi-Domain Digital Twin for Combined Cycle Power Plants. Includes archived numerical inputs/results, simulation kernels, ontology runtime, and 79 engineering-contract cases. See docs/COVERAGE.md for the unrecovered original 55-case comparison and other scope limits."
